[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11461.15, "timestamp": "03:11:01", "text": "离开。闪烁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11463.75, "timestamp": "03:11:03", "text": "嗯哼。那个人。我认为闪烁是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11466.15, "timestamp": "03:11:06", "text": "就像预兆，预示着什么事情即将发生。后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11468.95, "timestamp": "03:11:08", "text": "那你就等着吧。我觉得这个声音是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11470.55, "timestamp": "03:11:10", "text": "就像一种确认。就像我猜的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11484.75, "timestamp": "03:11:24", "text": "好的。那个开关在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11494.15, "timestamp": "03:11:34", "text": "正确的。老兄，我太习惯一直按着Shift键了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11496.55, "timestamp": "03:11:36", "text": "冲刺。他妈的。每次我冲刺的时候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11509.73, "timestamp": "03:11:49", "text": "60"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11512.349, "timestamp": "03:11:52", "text": "[音乐]"}]